{"title":"UK Mathematical Olympiad for Girls","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>UK Mathematical Olympiad for Girls</b> (<b>UK MOG</b>) is a mathematical olympiad for women/girls in the United Kingdom. It is held by the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=UK_Mathematics_Trust&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"UK Mathematics Trust (page does not exist)\">UK Mathematics Trust</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=UK_Mathematical_Olympiad_for_Girls&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=UK_Mathematical_Olympiad_for_Girls_Past_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"UK Mathematical Olympiad for Girls Past Problems and Solutions\">UK Mathematical Olympiad for Girls Past Problems and Solutions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=European_Girls%E2%80%99_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"European Girls’ Mathematical Olympiad (page does not exist)\">European Girls’ Mathematical Olympiad</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematical_Competition_for_Girls&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Mathematical Competition for Girls (page does not exist)\">Mathematical Competition for Girls</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=UK_Mathematical_Olympiad_for_Girls&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: External links\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ukmt.org.uk/mathematical-olympiad-for-girls\">Official UKMT Mathematical Olympiad for Girls page</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://bmos.ukmt.org.uk/home/ukmog.shtml\">Past UK MOG papers and solutions on BMOS</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=UK_Mathematical_Olympiad_for_Girls&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018184958\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.018 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 16/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 343/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.268      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    6.268      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:38066:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018184958 and revision id 293807. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}